            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1854] &quot;Per User&quot; mode in interpreter setting should be visible even if there is no role assigned to a user</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1854</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There can be a case where user may have enabled shiro authentication, but may not have configured role based mapping.&lt;/p&gt;

