                            <comment id="15776774" author="githubbot" created="Sun, 25 Dec 2016 17:25:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user cloverhearts commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1797&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1797&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    When shiro is enabled, an anonymous user may exist.&lt;br/&gt;
    If so, this code stops all functionality for the user named anonymous.&lt;br/&gt;
    Therefore, I have to additionally validate the role assigned to the user.&lt;br/&gt;
    I think there are many opinions about this.&lt;br/&gt;
    Whether a non-role user is a normal user or is able to change settings.&lt;br/&gt;
    @prabhjyotsingh @jongyoul If you do not mind, can you tell us your opinion?&lt;/p&gt;

</comment>
                            <comment id="15778393" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 26 Dec 2016 14:09:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user prabhjyotsingh commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

